category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"OJ8TFOwK5fTQQbvBZl7a3w","review_id":"907EPGvzHCMEsg2PediJgA","date":"2020-01-05T02:00:05","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9343081712722778,"text_excerpt":"Very cute addition to city park! We didn't go to the children's museum but we were in city park and wanted a snack. They have kid friendly items but also ~adult~ items as well. The restaurant was very cute and well decorated. There is an outside porch that you can sit and eat your food. When you enter you go up to the counter and order and they give you a letter and bring your food out to you. We ordered the shrimp roll and a side of broccoli and cauliflower. The shrimp roll was delicious and came with really large shrimp! We went for more of a snack but I would definitely love to try one of their bowls! This place is great for families but is also great if you're just in city park and wa..."},{"business_id":"OJ8TFOwK5fTQQbvBZl7a3w","review_id":"D4uhL_5rDk_NdufH3bv6aA","date":"2021-03-03T04:28:57","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9275888204574585,"text_excerpt":"This place is a cute little restaurant tucked in the side of the children's museum in city park. Although I believe it's main purpose is to serve guests of the museum it is open to all. There is beautiful outdoor seating and well as family- friendly seating inside. They have many family events such as egg decorating during Easter. The food was incredible and I was completely blown away by the cauliflower \"wings\". The homemade pop tart is so flaky and delicious. They also have a picnic lunch on their menu which can be taken to go and enjoyed in city park!"},{"business_id":"OJ8TFOwK5fTQQbvBZl7a3w","review_id":"9xuW1n6hHD5vXVi7-x478g","date":"2021-01-24T22:05:32","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9247479438781738,"text_excerpt":"Really cute place attached to the Children's Museum that offers homey fair and outdoor and indoor seating options. They also offer a variety of adult beverages for anyone who wants to chill outside and sip on a beer. I had the Tuna Melt which comes with a side of chips. It was a tasty and filling meal overall. If you're looking to sit outside and have a very chill meal then this is the place for you."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"OJ8TFOwK5fTQQbvBZl7a3w","photo_id":"15RlMTeWEtpb2p0lNHN02g","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/15RlMTeWEtpb2p0lNHN02g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8508058786392212},{"business_id":"OJ8TFOwK5fTQQbvBZl7a3w","photo_id":"jAdrIbyOYPKVuak65zfbhg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/jAdrIbyOYPKVuak65zfbhg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8504025936126709},{"business_id":"OJ8TFOwK5fTQQbvBZl7a3w","photo_id":"RxMCrB2iWycvev8e1o0hWA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/RxMCrB2iWycvev8e1o0hWA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.84711754322052},{"business_id":"OJ8TFOwK5fTQQbvBZl7a3w","photo_id":"ledqI0cYJ8eaT2O3tsvRPw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/ledqI0cYJ8eaT2O3tsvRPw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8452113270759583},{"business_id":"OJ8TFOwK5fTQQbvBZl7a3w","photo_id":"qWdyGhMs557BOamwu08ULw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/qWdyGhMs557BOamwu08ULw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8287321329116821}]},"notebook_case":null}
